# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JEE Academic OS — environment variables (SERVER-SIDE ONLY)
#
# IMPORTANT: There is deliberately NO real .env file in this project.
# NEVER create one with a real key and commit it to GitHub — anyone
# could read it. Instead, set these in the Vercel dashboard:
#
#   Vercel → your project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# The /api functions read them with process.env.* on the server.
# The browser never sees them.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required for AI Coach server mode — get yours at openrouter.ai/settings/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# Optional: protect /api from strangers. Any secret word you choose.
# Enter the same word in the app: AI Coach → "Use server key" → access code.
ACCESS_CODE=
